---
import PillarLayout from '../../layouts/PillarLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<PillarLayout slug="heating">

  <section class="section bg-sand-2" style="padding:clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0">
    <div class="container pillar-detail__wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow"><Icon name="flame" size={15} /> No-heat calls answered fast</span>
      <h2>When the heat stops, we do not make you wait</h2>
      <div class="pillar-detail__body">
        <p>A furnace that quits in a Huron County January is an emergency, and our 24-hour line is set up for exactly that. We diagnose the failure honestly, carry the common parts, and tell you plainly whether the fix is a part or a replacement. A replacement is sized to the home and the fuel, natural gas or propane, never a one-size number.</p>
        <p>For homes on boiler or radiant heat, we install and service Weil-McLain, Slant/Fin, and BAXI equipment and keep the hydronic side balanced with the rest of the system. Heat pumps, humidifiers, dehumidifiers, and heat-recovery ventilators round out the heating work, all done by the same gas-certified crew.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PillarLayout>
